#!/bin/sh
# Codex poses for reel-08, all from the character sheet. Run from the repo root.
cd /home/user/vibe_editing
STYLE="Same pen-and-wash style as the reference sheet: thin dark sepia fineliner lines, loose transparent watercolour slightly off the lines, darker dried edges. Plain white paper background, nothing else drawn: no floor, no scenery, no text, no cast shadow. Full body, nothing cropped."
G="sh tools/lemo.sh .venv/bin/python core/image/gen_image.py"
$G "The same woman as in the reference sheet (same face, ponytail, coral sleeveless top, navy leggings, white trainers), taking a mirror selfie: standing facing the viewer, holding a black phone up in her right hand in front of her chest so it does not hide her face, left hand resting on her hip, weight on one leg, a small proud smile. $STYLE" --aspect 2:3 --ref "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen/sheet_20261113-202148.png" --out "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen" --name selfie
$G "The same woman as in the reference sheet, seen from the side facing LEFT, out of breath after a workout: bent forward at the hips, both hands resting on her knees, knees slightly bent, head up looking ahead, mouth open breathing hard, cheeks flushed, a few sweat drops, ponytail falling forward. $STYLE" --aspect 1:1 --ref "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen/sheet_20261113-202148.png" --out "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen" --name tired
$G "Walk cycle sheet: the same woman as in the reference sheet, seen from the side walking to the RIGHT, relaxed happy stroll. Four frames in one row, evenly spaced with clear gaps, all the same size and on the same baseline: 1 right foot forward heel down, 2 passing pose with the left leg lifting, 3 left foot forward heel down, 4 passing pose with the right leg lifting. Arms swing opposite to the legs. $STYLE" --aspect 16:9 --ref "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen/sheet_20261113-202148.png" --out "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen" --name walk
$G "The same woman as in the reference sheet, standing facing the viewer and waving hello with her right hand raised beside her head, palm open, elbow bent, left arm relaxed, a warm open smile, friendly and inviting. $STYLE" --aspect 2:3 --ref "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen/sheet_20261113-202148.png" --out "/home/user/vibe_editing/projects/reel-08/gen" --name wave
